# Production sanctuary imagery is part of the deployed application bundle.
!apps/web/src/shala/assets/images/*.jpg

# Files that emails link to are part of the deployment too — they are served
# from the site root and an email cannot reach anything that is not committed.
# Without this, `git add -A` skips them SILENTLY: the working tree and the
# local build both look correct while the file never reaches the repo.
# See docs/assets/EMAIL-LINKED-FILES.md
!apps/web/public/email/*.jpg
!apps/web/public/email/*.jpeg
!apps/web/public/email/*.png

